        "original_id": "dd0abd93-88c0-5c51-9fc0-3fa4e9b8ab0e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Conspirare\n- People: Eric Whitacre, Tarik O'Regan, David Lang, Jocelyn Hagen, Donald Grantham, Nico Muhly, Mark Adamo, Robert Kyr, Jake Heggie, Eric Banks, Jake Runestad\n- Products: Tarik O'Regan: Threshold of Night\n- Concepts: Virtual Choir\n\nFacts:\n- Conspirare has commissioned works from composers including David Lang, Tarik O'Regan, Jocelyn Hagen, Donald Grantham, Eric Whitacre, Nico Muhly, Mark Adamo, Robert Kyr, Jake Heggie, Eric Banks, and Jake Runestad.\n- Eric Whitacre, born on January 2, 1970, is an American composer, conductor, and speaker who has won a Grammy.\n- Eric Whitacre is known for choral, orchestral, and wind ensemble music.\n- Eric Whitacre is also known for his Virtual Choir projects, which bring together individual voices from around the world into an online choir.\n- Tarik O'Regan: Threshold of Night is the third release by Conspirare.\n- Tarik O'Regan: Threshold of Night is the second recording of the work of Tarik O'Regan by Conspirare.",
